    description: "Surfaced by the BROAD validation drain (session broad-20260706-153915). Real data-quality bug: Symbol.language is set to a FILE PATH instead of a language name on some symbols — openzeppelin-contracts carries relative .sol import paths ('../../../../token/ERC1155/ERC1155.sol' etc.) as the language value (solidity import resolution), and phoenix carries 'priv/static/phoenix.cjs.js' / 'priv/static/phoenix.mjs' / 'index.js' (static JS assets). Separately Symbol.language='asciidoc' (x36) and 'gradle' (x8) are unregistered language values (catalog gap, minor). All are axis_conformance violations blocking INV-numat. Fix the language=path producer bug (highest value); register or reject asciidoc/gradle."  # 98fc
